crates/server-http/src/http/request.rs (L32 to 39)
  Note: The raw `Content-Length` header value is echoed back to the client in the error.
```
fn validate_content_length(value: &str) -> Result<u64, ServerError> {
    value
        .parse::<u64>()
        .map_err(|_| ServerError::InvalidRequest {
            reason: format!("invalid Content-Length: {value}"),
        })
}
```
